ose to jog rock farmers walk  or crawl to the shops  you can choose to squat while you watch  tv it's harder  but it's just as effective i call this  adaptive  immersion training and the simple  formula looks like this  adaptation equals environment times  organism times intent  all multiplied by plasticity  change the environment change the  organism  so i hope you found this one useful and  interesting guys it's some high concept  stuff but i feel it could be useful for  some people  let me know if you train like this how  does your environment shape your body  and performance  if you did enjoy this then please  consider leaving a like and sharing it  around  that helps me out immensely you could  also subscribe and hit the bell button  to ensure you're notified of new uploads  and some awesome news i think we've now  just crossed 400 000 subscribers which  is  insane so thank you all so much for that  and i thought a cool way to mark the  occasion might be with a q a it's  something people have asked me to do in  the past so  if you have any questions you'd like to  ask you can ask them in the comments  down below  on instagram i'll be posting about it or  on the facebook page  you'll find everything you need to know  in the description if you like this kind  of training that looks at the body and  the mind and  all different aspects of performance  then you might enjoy my ebook and  training program  super functional training there's a  discount on right now during the  pandemic  and you can find the link to that in  description down below also  or if you want to know where a lot of  this stuff came from then check out my  print book functional training  and beyond that i discuss functional  training as a concept  and how we can apply it to our training  and our general lives  either way thank you so much for  watching this one guys thanks for all  your support  and i'll see you next time bye  for now

